EXISTING_IMPLEMENTATIONS: [
  {system: "SGLang adaptive speculative decoding", url: "https://sgl-project.github.io/advanced_features/adaptive_speculative_decoding.html", overlap: "Direct: adjusts speculative_num_steps/speculative_num_draft_tokens at runtime from observed accepted draft length via EMA tiers [1,3,7], instead of one fixed server value."},
  {system: "Hugging Face Transformers dynamic speculation", url: "https://huggingface.co/blog/dynamic_speculation_lookahead", overlap: "Direct mechanism overlap: num_assistant_tokens is increased when all speculative tokens match and decreased on rejection; assistant_confidence_threshold stops drafting early on low confidence."},
  {system: "vLLM Suffix Decoding", url: "https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/features/speculative_decoding/suffix.html", overlap: "Partial: speculates an adaptive number of tokens per request/iteration, with num_speculative_tokens as a maximum; targets high-acceptance repetitive/agentic workloads."},
  {system: "TensorRT-LLM guided + speculative decoding", url: "https://github.com/NVIDIA/TensorRT-LLM/blob/main/docs/source/blogs/tech_blog/blog12_Combining_Guided_Decoding_and_Speculative_Decoding.md", overlap: "Partial: combines grammar-guided decoding with speculative decoding for JSON/tool-style outputs and measures acceptance on H200 JSON workloads; states draft length is fixed for all requests."}
]
CONTRIBUTION_TYPE: integration-only
SCALE_REALISM: Does not currently hold at realistic workload. Packet reports adaptive vs best-tuned fixed median gain +1.56% for f<=0.35 and +1.33% in the realistic agentic cell f in {0.1,0.2}, gap<=0.30, below the pre-registered 3%/5% gates. Artifact is CPU analytic plus MC only; no real agent traces, no measured emitted-token constrained fraction f, no real draft/target acceptance by region, and no GPU wall-clock including launch/verify/KV overhead.
RATIONALE: A shipping system already implements the core systems mechanism: SGLang documents runtime adaptive speculative decoding that follows observed accept length and switches prebuilt CUDA-graph/runtime-state tiers. HF Transformers independently ships dynamic speculation based on match/confidence. The packet’s remaining grammar-region label is not enough for a systems green: TensorRT-LLM already studies guided decoding plus speculative decoding on JSON/agent-style workloads, and the packet’s own best-tuned fixed baseline captures almost all gain in prose-dominated regimes. Reproducibility of the L0 artifact is acceptable for the analytic claim, but insufficient for the requested systems claim at scale.
